  "notes": "Driving Empire is an open world driving and racing game from Voldex, the studio that also runs Brookhaven. You earn Cash by driving, racing, and doing jobs, then buy from more than 300 cars and boats, many from real brands like Lamborghini, McLaren, and Porsche. You can tune and customize every car, join races and car meets, and roleplay around a big map with friends.\n\nCodes mostly give Cash, plus the odd free car or pack of tuning kits. Cash is the most useful reward because it goes straight toward the car you are saving for, while free cars are nice extras for your garage. New codes usually drop with the game's regular updates, like the Rivian update in late September 2026, and for milestones, and they are posted on X and in the Discord.",
