  "faq": [
    {
      "q": "Why is my Driving Empire code not working?",
      "a": "Driving Empire codes expire quickly, often within a few weeks, so older codes like 10KITS and MARCH2026 no longer work. Also check that you typed it in all capitals with no spaces."
    },
    {
      "q": "Where do I find the codes box in Driving Empire?",
      "a": "It is inside the Settings menu. Click the gear icon on the left of the screen and look for the Codes section with the Input code box."
    },
    {
      "q": "Can I get free cars from Driving Empire codes?",
      "a": "Yes, some codes give a car instead of Cash. Right now USA250 gives the Rocket Car and 2MLIKES gives a 2017 Nissan GT-R."
    }
  ],
